<pre>


Name: The Master Merchants
Command: merchant
Creators: Duke and Shadowjack
Your level: 25
Maximum level: 25


Description:
Merchants are the respected business people of BatMUD.  Although they may lack
the combat experience of adventurers, their training gives them great
influence in society and makes them an integral part of the economy.

Joining requirements:
 Background must be civilized (passed)
Abilities gained when joining:
 You are now a member of the Merchant Council.
 You have received a gilded abacus, symbol of your profession.
